AQTQtQ_GDQ-pgGBVvlp4FEIUCDDwkqFR4-5OAGld1H2-gw&oe=6B0B27F7"}, {"file_name": "ed roland.png", "id": "1047067571263658", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499312454_1047067574596991_3545592460762382153_n.png?_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=SbZv_GiU1qwQ7kNvwFtZgcS&_nc_oc=AdpfV5m5lgFTk_MYT9wL8hKsxSWlIx_y7X__rAy8WL0EyBxMJ5yju3O0zED11L7qk3k&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQSU0eNHtWeD-8EcuC_y3RylV3B4mvx4aVucn24F38__yQ&oe=6B0B1707"}, {"file_name": "1.png", "id": "1592824024803033", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974593_1592824028136366_2785707857221777252_n.png?_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=U6RGfPLpbzAQ7kNvwG0gV9e&_nc_oc=Adry1F89E1RKpHGDZ_KMLV3vwx0SDc5HMWhM_I-BqqjS_VhhOKWpd1p_SwWTv6yVfvk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQQhdRXSDucWZa7vteAqL-Igl3beHdlgjAQiFcMwT08k6A&oe=6B0B3917"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "splash_16-9.png", "id": "1819072665376918", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491828816_1819072668710251_7353430703769565817_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=dOCKnd_t7A0Q7kNvwEzTKzt&_nc_oc=AdpQrCaq6zHCP1n_K_EN1_BKepNQvnGG7JmWtjVX80sA49jcJe-9TH30nxgfi2F804Q&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQSR1e2vOXP1g3sYt69-C2kBipcGZFAeVbGEHRrZen2JqA&oe=6B0B300F"}, "display_name": "Soapbox - Live Performers In Your House", "keywords": ["hologram", "comedy", "music", "lineup", "concert"], "long_description": "Soapbox puts life-size holograms of real musicians and comedians in your living room. Walk around them. They are volumetric captures of the actual people - not avatars, not CGI, not 360 video.\n\nBuild an Instant House Show: pick a lineup, queue performances back to back, and watch them appear in mixed reality (passthrough, in your room) or in a full VR venue.\n\nThe catalog includes T-Pain, Buddy Guy, Yelawolf, Soulja Boy, Jim Jones, Waka Flocka Flame, Norma Jean, Tank, and more. Plus stand-up you can put in the same lineup.\n\nFree to download and explore. Unlock premier performances with one-off purchases or a monthly or yearly subscription.\n\nSoapbox is the only way to have your favorite artists appear life-size in your space.", "short_description": "New users get 3 days free!\n\nLife-size holograms of real musicians and comedians in your living room. Build an Instant House Show: pick a lineup, queue performances, and watch them appear in mixed reality or a full VR venue. No avatars - volumetric captures of the actual artists. \n\nFree to download, with a catalog you can explore."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "splash_portrait.png", "id": "1770420413866405", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491827063_1770420417199738_9163659578469219972_n.png?_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=gfmuFln_42MQ7kNvwHNcQYS&_nc_oc=AdpKRqYGaYf3u01hxYlUx_J0cMs6uF0d72rYP08xakEZLbez6894-7qY3GVuDopfsRo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQToBVkJBMnr3Q6Y2-BUXmT6jJhxwjUjNKr84b2Z2qa8fQ&oe=6B0B3975"}, {"file_name": "splash_square.png", "id": "1433199797716384", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499300910_1433199801049717_1165102973676556133_n.png?_nc_cat=105&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Xj8T100mIQoQ7kNvwGTktx3&_nc_oc=AdpqtvEsMAlCRr-yCWKot3qeepAJFxHL429jg2VYqgWZLl8-w8wDHqBVjkwVoFBwCpw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQQxBBr5Q6f9fDCY_5gcRws0p8Fm3sczztaiUcDgJXsGLw&oe=6B0B32C5"}, {"file_name": "meta banner.png", "id": "1408416804241288", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499305071_1408416807574621_5283805827554035897_n.png?_nc_ca